info: on gcp: Cloud Run runs services with less than 1 vCPU one request at a time; api uses 1 vCPU
 --> full.clowd:7:3
  |
7 |   cpu 0.5
  |   ^^^^^^^

info: on gcp: internal_lb has no `send /` route, so paths no route matches go to worker
  --> full.clowd:34:4
   |
34 | lb internal_lb is internal
   |    ^^^^^^^^^^^

